## Creation checklists

### New feature (`src/features/`)

1. `hooks/use<Feature>.ts` (+ `use<Feature>Mutations.ts` if needed)
2. `components/` — page shell; compose from `@/shared/modules/*` when possible
3. `schemas/index.ts` / `types/index.ts` if forms or filters exist
4. `pages/<Feature>Page.tsx` if it owns a route
5. `index.ts` — re-export hooks/components; **exclude** pages

### New shared module (`src/shared/modules/`)

1. `services/<action>.service.ts` + `services/index.ts`
2. `hooks/use<Domain>Table.ts` — orchestration + infinity table `fetchFn` at `hooks/` root
3. `hooks/queries/` for list/detail `useQuery` hooks; `hooks/mutations/` for create/update/delete
4. `components/<domain>Table.component.tsx` + `components/index.ts`
5. `columns/<domain>Columns.tsx` if the module has a data table
6. `constants/initialFilters.ts` + `constants/filters.ts` when filters exist
7. `types/*.types.ts` + `types/index.ts` for filter/param shapes
8. `utils/build*QueryParams.ts` / `*Export.ts` when needed — **no** `*Mapper.ts` if backend DTOs suffice
9. `modals/` if add/edit/detail flows exist
10. `index.ts` — export hooks, `components/`, `services/`; **exclude** pages

