## Tests (`tests/`)

All tests live under **`tests/`** at the repo root — never beside production files in `src/`.

| Production | Test |
|------------|------|
| `src/features/orders/hooks/useOrders.ts` | `tests/features/orders/hooks/useOrders.test.ts` |
| `src/shared/modules/CustomersModule/hooks/queries/useCustomersMetrics.ts` | `tests/shared/modules/CustomersModule/hooks/queries/useCustomersMetrics.test.ts` |

- Mirror the `src/` folder path under `tests/`
- Import production code with `@/`; import test helpers with `@tests/helpers/...`
- See `04-testing/` for unit and API test requirements

